# Frontend files

For a **new screen, layout pass, or multi-component change**, read
`.cursor/skills/sosedo-frontend/SKILL.md` and the one reference you need
(admin / mobile / react / testing / visual-qa).

For a typo, a single token, or a one-line style fix: skip the skill.

`AGENTS.md` and `docs/current.md` still win on scope and architecture.
